      "title": "Prepare agarose gel",
      "instruction": "Combine 0.4 g agarose with 40 mL TAE, boil, add water up to 40 mL to replace loss, mix well, then pour 35 mL into a clean 7 × 10 cm casting rig.",
      "substeps": [
